---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CardIcon from "../components/ui/CardIcon.astro";
import homeVideoScriptUrl from "../scripts/home-video.js?url";

---

<BaseLayout
  title="BLACKPROOF - Répondre aux questionnaires cyber clients"
  description="Importez un questionnaire cyber client, préparez les réponses et exportez un dossier prêt à transmettre. Vos contenus restent dans votre navigateur."
>
  <section class="hero home-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Questionnaires cyber clients</p>
        <h1>Préparez des réponses solides sans envoyer <span class="proof-word">vos preuves sensibles.</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Importez le questionnaire, rédigez les réponses, rattachez les justificatifs et signalez
          les informations à ne pas partager. BLACKPROOF conserve le dossier dans votre navigateur
          et exporte une version relue pour votre client.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/demo">Voir la démonstration</a>
          <a class="button" href="/open-source">Découvrir le logiciel libre</a>
          <a class="text-action" href="/security">Sécurité et confidentialité <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="compatibility-note">
          <strong>Création et export :</strong> Chrome ou Edge sur ordinateur uniquement.
          Firefox, Safari et les navigateurs mobiles ne sont pas pris en charge actuellement.
        </p>
        <div class="trust-strip" role="list" aria-label="Principes BLACKPROOF">
          <span role="listitem">Données dans votre navigateur</span>
          <span role="listitem">Aucun tracker</span>
          <span role="listitem">Sans CDN</span>
          <span role="listitem">Fichiers exportables</span>
          <span role="listitem">Intégrité vérifiable</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="proof-visual" aria-label="Aperçu d’un dossier questionnaire dans BLACKPROOF">
        <div class="visual-topline">
          <span>Questionnaire client</span>
          <strong>BP-2026-0710</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="proof-pipeline" role="list" aria-label="Chaîne de traitement">
          <div class="pipeline-node active" role="listitem">
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>Questionnaire</strong>
            <small>importé</small>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-node" role="listitem">
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>Preuves</strong>
            <small>attendues</small>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-node warning" role="listitem">
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>Réserves</strong>
            <small>à documenter</small>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-node ok" role="listitem">
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>Dossier</strong>
            <small>prêt à relire</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="proof-dashboard">
          <div class="score-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" aria-labelledby="score-title">
              <title id="score-title">Indicateur de préparation du dossier, valeur 78</title>
              <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="48" class="ring-bg"></circle>
              <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="48" class="ring-value"></circle>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <strong>78</strong>
              <span>à relire</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="evidence-stack">
            <div class="evidence-row ok">
              <span></span>
              <p>Politique MFA</p>
              <strong>déclarée disponible</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-row warning">
              <span></span>
              <p>Test de restauration</p>
              <strong>partiel</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-row blocked">
              <span></span>
              <p>Registre fournisseurs</p>
              <strong>réservé</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="integrity-bar">
          <div>
            <span>Empreinte</span>
            <code>bp_sha256_9f3c...a71e</code>
          </div>
          <strong>contrôlable</strong>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section demo-video-section" aria-labelledby="demo-video-title">
    <div class="container video-showcase">
      <div class="video-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Démonstration guidée</p>
        <h2 id="demo-video-title">Voir le parcours BLACKPROOF en situation.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Du questionnaire au ZIP client vérifié, suivez le parcours du logiciel libre
          avec des données fictives. Aucun document n’est envoyé à BLACKPROOF.
        </p>
        <p class="video-note">Vidéo muette et légendée. Cliquez sur l’aperçu pour la regarder en grand.</p>
        <details class="video-transcript">
          <summary>Lire le parcours sans vidéo</summary>
          <ol>
            <li>Ouvrir le logiciel libre sans compte et sélectionner le CSV fictif sur son appareil.</li>
            <li>Relire les dix questions, puis créer le dossier chiffré avec une phrase secrète.</li>
            <li>Rédiger une réponse et documenter une référence de preuve, sans envoyer le document.</li>
            <li>Relire le contenu exact sélectionné et télécharger une version client partielle : une réponse, les neuf autres restant à travailler.</li>
            <li>Télécharger aussi une sauvegarde chiffrée du dossier de travail. Le ZIP client ne remplace pas cette sauvegarde.</li>
            <li>Vérifier localement le ZIP client qui vient d’être exporté, puis rouvrir le dossier avec sa phrase secrète.</li>
          </ol>
          <p>Les contrôles d’intégrité ne constituent ni une certification, ni une validation de la véracité des déclarations. Vous transmettez les exports vous-même, hors de BLACKPROOF.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <button
        class="video-launch"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Voir la démonstration du parcours BLACKPROOF en plein écran"
        aria-haspopup="dialog"
        aria-controls="blackproof-demo-video"
        data-video-open
      >
        <span class="video-frame">
          <img
            src="/media/blackproof-parcours-local-poster.jpg"
            width="1400"
            height="900"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            alt="Démonstration de BLACKPROOF sous AGPL : dossiers locaux, sans compte, données fictives"
          />
          <span class="video-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="video-badge" aria-hidden="true">Parcours local · AGPL</span>
          <span class="video-play" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
        </span>
        <span class="video-launch-copy">
          <strong>Voir la démonstration</strong>
          <span>Lecture plein écran</span>
        </span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <dialog
    id="blackproof-demo-video"
    class="video-dialog"
    aria-labelledby="video-dialog-title"
    data-video-dialog
  >
    <div class="video-dialog-shell">
      <div class="video-dialog-header">
        <p id="video-dialog-title">Parcours utilisateur BLACKPROOF</p>
        <button type="button" aria-label="Fermer la vidéo" data-video-close>Fermer</button>
      </div>
      <video
        controls
        preload="none"
        poster="/media/blackproof-parcours-local-poster.jpg"
        data-video-player
      >
        <source src="/media/blackproof-parcours-local.webm" type="video/webm" />
        <track kind="captions" src="/media/blackproof-parcours-local.fr.vtt" srclang="fr" label="Français" />
        <p>
          Votre navigateur ne peut pas lire cette vidéo.
          <a href="/media/blackproof-parcours-local.webm">Télécharger la démonstration</a>.
        </p>
      </video>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <section class="section home-section">
    <div class="container section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quand l’utiliser</p>
        <h2>Quand une réponse client engage votre crédibilité et vos données sensibles.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        BLACKPROOF prépare une sortie concrète : des réponses relues, les justificatifs associés,
        les réserves visibles et les actions restantes avant transmission au client.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="container evidence-grid">
      <article class="evidence-card">
        <CardIcon name="repeat" tone="blue" />
        <p class="kpi">01 / situation</p>
        <h3>Questionnaires répétitifs</h3>
        <p>Les réponses reviennent, les preuves changent, les réserves se perdent et la revue devient un risque commercial.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="evidence-card highlighted">
        <CardIcon name="package" tone="teal" />
        <p class="kpi">02 / résultat</p>
        <h3>Dossier exportable</h3>
        <p>Un questionnaire réel, un dossier enregistré dans votre navigateur et des fichiers prêts à relire avant envoi.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="evidence-card">
        <CardIcon name="route" tone="gold" />
        <p class="kpi">03 / suite</p>
        <h3>Travail réutilisable</h3>
        <p>Le dossier peut être rouvert et servir de base au prochain questionnaire client.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section persona-section">
    <div class="container section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pour qui</p>
      <h2>Trois situations où BLACKPROOF devient immédiatement utile.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="container persona-grid">
      <article class="persona-card">
        <div class="persona-card-head">
          <CardIcon name="shield" tone="teal" />
          <span class="persona-label">RSSI / DPO</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Répondre sans exposer plus que nécessaire.</h3>
        <p>Structurer une réponse client, identifier les preuves sensibles et documenter les réserves avant envoi.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="persona-card">
        <div class="persona-card-head">
          <CardIcon name="layers" tone="violet" />
          <span class="persona-label">Fournisseur SaaS B2B</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Structurer les revues cyber récurrentes.</h3>
        <p>Reprendre un dossier local, produire des exports explicites et éviter les réponses dispersées dans des fichiers fragiles.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="persona-card">
        <div class="persona-card-head">
          <CardIcon name="briefcase" tone="gold" />
          <span class="persona-label">Cabinet cyber</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Passer de la revue déclarative au livrable.</h3>
        <p>Transformer une collecte de réponses en dossier lisible, vérifiable et directement exploitable.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section workflow-section">
    <div class="container workflow-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Fonctionnement</p>
        <h2>Du questionnaire reçu au dossier prêt à transmettre.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Quand un grand compte, un assureur ou un donneur d'ordre demande des réponses cyber,
          BLACKPROOF distingue les réponses prêtes, les justificatifs disponibles, les réserves
          et les informations qui ne doivent pas être exportées.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-board" role="list" aria-label="Flux BLACKPROOF">
        <div class="flow-step" role="listitem">
          <span>Répondre</span>
          <p>Formuler une réponse fournisseur prudente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step" role="listitem">
          <span>Justifier</span>
          <p>Relier chaque réponse aux documents qui permettent de l’étayer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step" role="listitem">
          <span>Protéger</span>
          <p>Signaler les informations partielles, sensibles ou non partageables.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step" role="listitem">
          <span>Partager</span>
          <p>Conserver le dossier complet et générer uniquement la version destinée au client.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step" role="listitem">
          <span>Vérifier</span>
          <p>Contrôler localement l'empreinte SHA-256.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section security-proof-section">
    <div class="container security-proof">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Protection des données</p>
        <h2>Conçu pour ne pas collecter vos preuves.</h2>
        <p>
          Vos questionnaires, réponses et justificatifs restent dans votre navigateur.
          BLACKPROOF ne les reçoit pas pour faire fonctionner le produit.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="security-grid" role="list" aria-label="Garanties de sécurité BLACKPROOF">
        <span role="listitem">Pas de tracker</span>
        <span role="listitem">Pas de Google Fonts</span>
        <span role="listitem">Pas de CDN</span>
        <span role="listitem">Sécurité du navigateur renforcée</span>
        <span role="listitem">Taille des imports limitée</span>
        <span role="listitem">Pas d'exécution de code importé</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section proofpack-section">
    <div class="container proofpack-band">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Livrable</p>
        <h2>Un dossier exportable avec cinq fichiers directement utilisables.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="artifact-list" role="list" aria-label="Contenu ProofPack">
        <span role="listitem">proofpack.json</span>
        <span role="listitem">reponse-fournisseur.md</span>
        <span role="listitem">registre-preuves.csv</span>
        <span role="listitem">plan-remediation.csv</span>
        <span role="listitem">note-synthese.md</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .video-frame,
    .video-dialog {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --text: #f3f6f2;
      --muted: #a8b2ab;
      --accent: #8ee5d1;
    }

    .video-transcript {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .video-transcript summary {
      color: var(--accent);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .video-transcript li + li { margin-top: 0.5rem; }

    .home-hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(4.6rem, 7.5vw, 6.8rem) 0 4.4rem;
    }

    .home-hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 11%, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.07), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.07)) 11% calc(11% + 1px), transparent calc(11% + 1px) 37%, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.045), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.045)) 37% calc(37% + 1px), transparent calc(37% + 1px) 72%, light-dark(rgba(108, 87, 53, 0.045), rgba(224, 182, 111, 0.045)) 72% calc(72% + 1px), transparent calc(72% + 1px)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0 63px, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.04), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.04)) 63px 64px);
      mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62), transparent 78%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .home-hero::after {
      position: absolute;
      top: -28rem;
      right: -25rem;
      width: 60rem;
      height: 60rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 37px, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.045), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.045)) 38px 39px, transparent 40px 62px);
      content: "";
      opacity: 0.9;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(420px, 0.92fr);
      gap: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4.6rem);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 740px;
      font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 4.35vw, 4.05rem);
    }

    .proof-word {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      color: light-dark(var(--muted), #f8fbf7);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .proof-word::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0.04em;
      bottom: -0.09em;
      left: 0.03em;
      height: 0.075em;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent) 78%, var(--accent-gold) 78% 84%, transparent 84%);
      box-shadow: 0 0.08em 0 rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.08);
      content: "";
    }

    .hero-copy .lead {
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .hero-copy .actions {
      align-items: center;
    }

    .compatibility-note {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .compatibility-note strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .text-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      min-height: 2.75rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.79rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      transition: color 160ms ease;
    }

    .text-action span {
      color: var(--accent);
      transition: transform 160ms ease;
    }

    .text-action:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .text-action:hover span {
      transform: translateX(2px);
    }

    .trust-strip {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      margin-top: 1.35rem;
    }

    .trust-strip span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.42rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
    }

    .trust-strip span::before {
      width: 0.28rem;
      height: 0.28rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(129, 218, 203, 0.28);
      content: "";
    }

    .proof-visual {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 5px;
      padding: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.15), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.15)), transparent 38%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.97), rgba(25, 35, 31, 0.97)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.99), rgba(7, 11, 10, 0.99)));
      box-shadow: -1px 0 0 var(--line-strong), 0 34px 100px light-dark(rgba(27, 57, 38, 0.09), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42));
    }

    .proof-visual::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035));
      border-radius: inherit;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .visual-topline,
    .integrity-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      border: 0;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, light-dark(rgba(68, 110, 100, 0.025), rgba(142, 229, 209, 0.025)) 0 1px, transparent 1px 8px),
        light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.024), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024));
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .visual-topline span,
    .integrity-bar span {
      color: var(--muted-2);
    }

    .visual-topline strong,
    .integrity-bar strong {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .proof-pipeline {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0;
      margin: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .pipeline-node {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 112px;
      border: 0;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 0.8rem;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.38), rgba(10, 13, 14, 0.38));
    }

    .pipeline-node:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .pipeline-node span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 1.6rem;
      height: 1.6rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
    }

    .pipeline-node strong,
    .pipeline-node small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.7rem;
    }

    .pipeline-node strong {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .pipeline-node small {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .pipeline-node.active {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.105), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.105)), light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.035), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.035)));
    }

    .pipeline-node.warning {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(103, 87, 53, 0.09), rgba(214, 181, 111, 0.09)), light-dark(rgba(103, 87, 53, 0.025), rgba(214, 181, 111, 0.025)));
    }

    .pipeline-node.ok {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(61, 96, 74, 0.09), rgba(128, 200, 154, 0.09)), light-dark(rgba(61, 96, 74, 0.025), rgba(128, 200, 154, 0.025)));
    }

    .proof-dashboard {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .score-ring,
    .evidence-stack {
      border: 0;
      background: light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.018), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.018));
    }

    .score-ring {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      min-height: 176px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .score-ring svg {
      width: 130px;
      height: 130px;
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
    }

    .ring-bg,
    .ring-value {
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 9;
    }

    .ring-bg {
      stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
    }

    .ring-value {
      stroke: var(--accent);
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-dasharray: 302;
      stroke-dashoffset: 66;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.24));
    }

    .score-ring div {
      position: absolute;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      gap: 0.15rem;
    }

    .score-ring strong {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .score-ring span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
    }

    .evidence-stack {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    }

    .evidence-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.7rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 2.65rem;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 0.58rem 0.18rem;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .evidence-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .evidence-row span {
      width: 0.58rem;
      height: 0.58rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--muted-2);
    }

    .evidence-row.ok span {
      background: var(--ok);
    }

    .evidence-row.warning span {
      background: var(--warning);
    }

    .evidence-row.blocked span {
      background: var(--danger);
    }

    .evidence-row p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .evidence-row strong {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
    }

    .integrity-bar {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .integrity-bar div {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.18rem;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .integrity-bar code {
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--text);
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .demo-video-section {
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .video-showcase {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.72fr) minmax(420px, 1.28fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 5px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%, light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.12), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.12)), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.96), rgba(23, 30, 28, 0.96)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.98), rgba(8, 11, 12, 0.98)));
      box-shadow: 0 28px 90px light-dark(rgba(27, 57, 38, 0.07), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24));
    }

    .video-copy .lead {
      max-width: 620px;
    }

    .video-note {
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .video-launch {
      display: grid;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.34), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.34));
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 0;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #080b0c);
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 52px light-dark(rgba(27, 57, 38, 0.09), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32));
      transition: border-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
    }

    .video-launch:hover {
      border-color: light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.72), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.72));
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px light-dark(rgba(27, 57, 38, 0.12), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4));
    }

    .video-launch:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .video-frame {
      position: relative;
      display: block;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #070a0b);
    }

    .video-frame img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 240ms ease;
    }

    .video-launch:hover .video-frame img {
      transform: scale(1.012);
    }

    .video-scrim {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.08), rgba(5, 8, 9, 0.08)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.48), rgba(5, 8, 9, 0.48))),
        radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 0 12%, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.18), rgba(4, 7, 8, 0.18)) 54%, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.48), rgba(4, 7, 8, 0.48)));
    }

    .video-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.35), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.35));
      border-left: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.35), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.35));
      border-radius: 0 0 0 12px;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.72rem;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #070a0b);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 760;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .video-play {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 4.6rem;
      height: 4.6rem;
      border: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.48), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48));
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.92);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.11), 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .video-play span {
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      margin-left: 0.28rem;
      border-top: 0.72rem solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 0.72rem solid transparent;
      border-left: 1.08rem solid #07100e;
    }

    .video-launch-copy {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
    }

    .video-launch-copy strong {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .video-launch-copy span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    .video-dialog {
      width: 100vw;
      max-width: none;
      height: 100dvh;
      max-height: none;
      margin: 0;
      border: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #030506);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .video-dialog::backdrop {
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.94), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.94));
    }

    .video-dialog-shell {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #030506);
    }

    .video-dialog-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.98), rgba(8, 11, 12, 0.98));
    }

    .video-dialog-header p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .video-dialog-header button {
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.48rem 0.72rem;
      background: light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.055), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055));
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .video-dialog video {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 0;
      object-fit: contain;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #000);
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .video-launch,
      .video-frame img {
        transition: none;
      }

      .video-launch:hover,
      .video-launch:hover .video-frame img {
        transform: none;
      }
    }

    .evidence-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.2fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .evidence-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 190px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 5px;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.92), rgba(22, 29, 27, 0.92)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.92), rgba(13, 17, 18, 0.92)));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-panel);
    }

    .evidence-card::after {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0.75rem 0.75rem auto auto;
      width: 1.7rem;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--card-accent, var(--accent)));
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    .evidence-card:nth-child(1) {
      --card-accent: var(--accent-blue);
    }

    .evidence-card:nth-child(3) {
      --card-accent: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    .evidence-card .kpi {
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
    }

    .evidence-card.highlighted {
      border-color: light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.36), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.36));
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.12), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.12)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.94), rgba(13, 17, 18, 0.94)));
    }

    .evidence-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    .workflow-section {
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .persona-section {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .persona-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .persona-card {
      min-height: 230px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 5px;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.94), rgba(22, 29, 27, 0.94)), light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.94), rgba(9, 12, 13, 0.94)));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-panel);
    }

    .persona-card-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .persona-card .persona-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 1.6rem;
      border: 1px solid light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.26), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.26));
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.26rem 0.52rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .persona-card h3 {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .persona-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    .workflow-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
      gap: 1.4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .flow-board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 5px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035));
    }

    .flow-step {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 174px;
      padding: 1rem 0.9rem;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .flow-step:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .flow-step::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.15rem;
      right: -0.38rem;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 0.7rem;
      height: 0.7rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 1), #121716);
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .flow-step:last-child::after {
      display: none;
    }

    .flow-step span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    .flow-step p {
      margin: 1.8rem 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .proofpack-band {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.78fr) minmax(0, 1.22fr);
      gap: 1.2rem;
      align-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 5px;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.1), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.1)), light-dark(rgba(61, 96, 74, 0.06), rgba(128, 200, 154, 0.06))),
        light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035));
    }

    .security-proof {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
      gap: 1.2rem;
      align-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 5px;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, light-dark(rgba(61, 96, 74, 0.08), rgba(128, 200, 154, 0.08)), light-dark(rgba(58, 104, 96, 0.065), rgba(121, 216, 200, 0.065))),
        light-dark(rgba(24, 66, 46, 0.03), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-tight);
    }

    .security-proof p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .security-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.55rem;
    }

    .security-grid span {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 3.1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.68rem;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.55), rgba(8, 11, 12, 0.55));
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 720;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .artifact-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.55rem;
    }

    .artifact-list span {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
      background: light-dark(rgba(248, 250, 246, 0.55), rgba(8, 11, 12, 0.55));
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .video-showcase,
      .workflow-layout,
      .security-proof,
      .proofpack-band {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .proof-visual {
        max-width: 760px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .home-hero {
        padding: 2.4rem 0 1.35rem;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .demo-video-section {
        padding-top: 0.7rem;
      }

      .video-showcase {
        gap: 1rem;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 0.85rem;
      }

      .video-launch-copy {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.2rem;
        padding: 0.72rem 0.8rem;
      }

      .video-play {
        width: 3.5rem;
        height: 3.5rem;
      }

      .video-play span {
        border-top-width: 0.55rem;
        border-bottom-width: 0.55rem;
        border-left-width: 0.84rem;
      }

      .hero-copy h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.04;
      }

      .hero-copy .lead {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .hero-copy .actions {
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .trust-strip {
        gap: 0.4rem;
        margin-top: 0.9rem;
      }

      .trust-strip span {
        padding: 0.2rem 0;
        font-size: 0.64rem;
      }

      .proof-visual {
        max-height: 260px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 0.75rem;
      }

      .visual-topline {
        padding: 0.55rem 0.62rem;
      }

      .proof-dashboard,
      .integrity-bar {
        display: none;
      }

      .proof-pipeline,
      .proof-dashboard,
      .evidence-grid,
      .persona-grid,
      .security-grid,
      .flow-board {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .proof-pipeline {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
      }

      .pipeline-node,
      .flow-step {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .pipeline-node {
        min-height: 84px;
        padding: 0.55rem;
      }

      .pipeline-node strong,
      .pipeline-node small {
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }

      .pipeline-node::before,
      .flow-step::after {
        display: none;
      }

      .flow-step {
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .flow-step:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <script src={homeVideoScriptUrl} defer></script>
</BaseLayout>
